WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.650
Here’s the conversion you’ll do most.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.200
You’ve plotted a course, and you need to tell the helmsman what to steer.

3
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.325
Follow it on screen.

4
00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:12.500
The plotted course is zero six eight, true.

5
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.650
Variation in the training chart’s area is about fourteen degrees west.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.700
We’re going down the chain, toward compass, so we add west.

7
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:26.350
Zero six eight plus fourteen is zero eight two, magnetic.

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.475
Now deviation.

9
00:00:28.725 --> 00:00:31.700
Which heading do you look up on the deviation card?

10
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.300
Zero eight two, the magnetic heading you just found.

11
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.875
The card says two degrees east.

12
00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:42.400
Still going down the chain, so subtract east.

13
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:46.200
Zero eight two minus two is zero eight zero.

14
00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.450
Steer zero eight zero.
